Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never lose!{\i0}\N{\i1}I won't{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:21.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Just a bit more" I said{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:25.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Swinging my hopes and fists{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:27.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not someone else's power{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Believe in your self{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:47.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The clash between strength and strength{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:51.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has always crossed oceans and skies{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:53.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Far into space{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:56.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rise to the front lines until the end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:58.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the ultimate hit{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Always in full attack{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:07.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't lose- I'll win!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alright nanana{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:13.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alright, let's get started{\i0}\N{\i1}on the final push!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:15.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty warrior, audacious{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:19.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believe in my power{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:23.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never lose!{\i0}\N{\i1}I won't{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:25.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Just a bit more" I said{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:29.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Swinging my hopes and fists{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:32.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All my efforts up until now{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:34.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And my frustrations fueled me{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not someone else's power{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:40.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Believe in your self{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:13.17,TopCenter,,0,0,0,,RESURRECTION 'F'
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:26.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You completely lack speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:37.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's because you're both\Nthinking before you act.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:40.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is especially true of Vegeta-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Look, I was even able to autograph you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:46.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You really are good, Whis-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:51.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's going on...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:54.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So noisy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:55.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Beerus-sama, you're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:00.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I can't sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:03.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Beerus-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Holy smokes...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I wasn't ready for that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:26.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can't put your guard down\Nwith him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:35.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey, come to think of it,\Nwhy are you two here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We're havin' Whis-san train us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:40.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:43.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I want to know how you guys got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:46.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We had Whis-san bring us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whis?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:51.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So you guys must've bribed Whis\Nwith some delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:56.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to take my place\Nas the God of Destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:05:00.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No, I just wanna get strong, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:03.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And I just don't want this guy\Nto get ahead of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:06.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They've been like this the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:09.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And what is the delicious food\Nyou brought?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:14.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I-I accidentally dropped it\Non the way this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:20.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You must've gone down to Earth\Nmany times while I was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:00.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,-Sorbet-sama.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:04.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The inhabitants of Planet 448\Nare revolting,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:06.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and our forces can't hold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:07.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:11.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And you call yourselves\Nthe elite of the dreaded Frieza Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:13.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Send in more troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:18.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Our greatest forces, Battalions One\Nand Two, have been annihilated,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:22.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and half of Battalion Three is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:24.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Our forces are fighting\Non other planets as well
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:26.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and can only spare a few troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:32.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Dammit!\NRetreat! Order a retreat!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We can't afford any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorbet-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:51.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Have you found the Namekian survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:53.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No, sir. We've had no luck as of yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:57.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right. We're going to Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But, isn't Earth dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:06.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you think we have\Nthe luxury of time on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:15.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Without Namekians, we have no choice\Nbut to brave the dangers of Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:18.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,-Tagoma, come with me to Earth!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:25.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Saiyans on Earth can sense strong\NPower Levels without the aid of scouters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:29.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they may notice\Nif we go in a large group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then perhaps it would be safer\Nif you remain here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:35.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,while Sisami and I go to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:37.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here and wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:42.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm going to resurrect Frieza-sama
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:44.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:03.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:05.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Piccolo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:07.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We took a little long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:08.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:15.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A little further! This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Just ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We did it, Shu, Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes, Pilaf-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:27.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We've collected all seven Dragon Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:31.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Just think how much\Nwe went through to get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:34.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I know, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:37.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We crossed oceans,{\i0}\N{\i1}scaled mountains,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fought all kinds of beasts...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:43.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And now, we've finally done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:49.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,With this, the world will be mine,\NEmperor Pilaf's!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:51.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hand over the Dragon Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:58.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:00.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,These are off limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:07.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Piccolo-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:10.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A terrible energy is moving that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:13.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:25.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're going to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:33.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,After all we did to gather them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:39.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,These are ours, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Mai! Stop being selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:47.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Those guys are bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:49.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:53.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,-Get started already!\N-Yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:17.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"Come forth, Shenron,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:20.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and grant my wish!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:30.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The sky went dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:33.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shenron?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:01.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is Shenron?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:07.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now, state your wish.\NI shall grant any wish you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:10.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There you go. Now please just spare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:14.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Here goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:23.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,B-Bring Frieza-sama back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Frieza-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well? Can't you grant any wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:42.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:49.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,However, that being's body was sliced up\Nlong ago and cannot be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:57.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Even if his soul were to be restored,\Nit would be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:11:59.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:01.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:02.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Even in pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:06.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,with the army's\Nlatest regeneration machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:08.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,we might be able to restore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:12.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right! That's right!\NFrieza-sama can probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:16.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't care if he's in pieces!\NJust bring him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:19.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're quite the arrogant one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:25.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,P-Please resurrect Frieza-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:29.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:47.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now, state your remaining two wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:50.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Two more wishes? You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:57.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's right. When Earth's god changed,\NI too was upgraded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:01.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,However, granting large wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:06.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,like resurrecting everyone on the planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:10.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,will take two wishes at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:11.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:17.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Two more wishes...\NShould we bring back Papa Frieza-sama too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:19.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I-I want a million Zeni!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:22.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I want the best ice cream in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:33.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:38.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:41.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Consider the dry ice a freebie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:44.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Your wishes have been granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:02.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was going to let you live\Nto collect the Dragon Balls, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorbet-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:07.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We should hurry.\NThe Saiyans might be coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:15.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was right about Frieza-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:19.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,With his vitality and our technology,\NI'm sure we can bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:31.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,-Let's get going.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:32.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:34.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.63,0:14:36.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:46.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well done.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:49.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll be back soon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:52.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With Frieza-sama and troops in tow!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:56.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:09.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Pilaf-sama,\Nwhat's this "Frieza" they mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:13.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't know! But whatever it is,\Nit doesn't sound pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:19.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's it!\NLet's build a spaceship and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? Can we build a spaceship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to manage\Nwith your million Zeni!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:28.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:33.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you ask for\Na hundred million or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:35.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What about your ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.79,0:15:37.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Once it melts, it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:41.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Th-This is something I've wanted\Nfor the longest time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:46.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:49.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I never even got a wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:56.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Pilaf-sama, we'll be able to feast\Nfor a while with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:00.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And we have\Nthe best ice cream in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:02.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.83,0:16:07.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy some ice cream,\Nand then go for a delicious meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:08.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:11.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What to eat after ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:14.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,-What to eat?\N-{\i1}Monjayaki{\i0}, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.29,0:16:28.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You two have gotten\Nmuch better than before,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but you still lack speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:33.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There'll always be a limit to your speed\Nthe way you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:40.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It takes time for your senses\Nand brain commands to reach your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That really does sound like you, Vegeta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.67,0:16:47.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're just brainless is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:53.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You need to teach every part of\Nyour bodies to respond on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:55.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But it's not an easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:59.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Not even Beerus-sama has mastered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:03.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you can overcome it,\Nyou will be able to avoid any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Can you do that, Whis-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:10.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But, Whis-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're steppin' in poo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:18.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,My shoes can't respond on their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now, Vegeta-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:23.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:30.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're a combat genius,\Nyet you continue to trail behind Goku-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:32.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I hate your bluntness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:37.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,H-How would I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:41.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's because your senses\Nare constantly on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:45.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That is why you cannot realize\Nyour full potential at crucial moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:49.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's important to relax them when you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Like Goku-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:54.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,He's right, Vegeta!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:57.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,On the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:03.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Being too relaxed is also a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:07.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And your overconfidence is a big issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:14.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You may be strong, but you're vulnerable\Nif you let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:19.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Your confidence has a tendency\Nto make you careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:21.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:24.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Aww c'mon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:30.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that training\Nis a little much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:34.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,At this rate,\Nthey're both really gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:39.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,At least let them become\NSuper Saiyan or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:40.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That would be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:41.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Pointless?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:48.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Those two can only just barely\Nsense a god's Ki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:51.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If that castle were\Nthe strength of a god,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:53.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,then those two are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:55.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,only this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:58.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If they don't increase\Nthe level of their Ki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:01.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,before they become Super Saiyan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:05.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,it will be insignificant\Neven if they do get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:08.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to see\Nthe world beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:11.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think they already know that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:17.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all, I never said they weren't{\i0}\N{\i1}allowed to become Super Saiyan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.79,0:19:19.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:22.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's none of my business,\Nbut try not to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:27.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's this, Oracle Fish-san?\NAre you actually worried about those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:30.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ever since they came,\NI've gotten more treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If they die, I won't get any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:34.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:41.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We managed to avoid\Ndetection by the Saiyans on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:46.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I told you, my calculations are flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But I still have concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:54.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:58.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Does our army really need Frieza-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:04.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Tagoma, how can you be Frieza-sama's\Ngeneral with such a feeble mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:13.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,When Frieza-sama is resurrected,\Nyou'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:28.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:30.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Be resurrected!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:17.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What is it, Kakarot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:20.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:22.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I felt something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.75,0:22:03.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What a strange feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:05.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Who would've ever imagined
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:09.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,that I'd be resurrected?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:17.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The face of a winner{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.67,0:22:19.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still hanging on, at the limit{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:21.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The paper dancing in the air{\i0}\N{\i1}flashes brilliantly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:24.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I piled up many failures along the way{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:25.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.29,0:22:27.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Standing tall, on my toes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:31.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The view matters more than a sprain{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:34.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you think sorrow could defeat me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:39.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I eat that up, three meals a day{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.33,0:22:41.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A strong wind surges again{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Many troubles come my way{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.25,0:22:46.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time to focus{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:48.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I swear{\i0}\N{\i1}I have high hopes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:51.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be complete in the near future{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A presence growing day by day by day{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.25,0:22:54.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the proof{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.79,0:22:58.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My life will make sparks fly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:01.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing I can't do{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.63,0:23:02.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pinnacle of perfection{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:06.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pinnacle of perfection{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:08.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pinnacle of perfection{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:12.67,TopCenter,,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:15.63,TopCenter,,0,0,0,,REVENGE 'F'

